# 랜딩 페이지 생성 — Overview

- **One-liner**: 방문자가 서비스를 빠르게 이해하고 CTA 버튼을 눌러 신청/문의까지 이어지게 하는 랜딩페이지
- **Device target**: Web (browser)

## Source of truth

`docs/PRD.md` is the **single source of truth**. Any code edit that diverges
from the PRD MUST be reflected back to `docs/PRD.md` in the same commit.

## AI team package (read first)

Before planning or coding, read **`.cubivora/TEAM.md`** (team overview + **Project Persona**)
and **`.cubivora/Memory.md`** (Why-Decision Log). These are **project-specific**
long-term memory — highest priority over generic assumptions.

